WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.530
It's pointless to resist.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:08.470
When this turn ends, Fujin's effect 
will deal you 1000 points of damage!

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.540
I end my turn!

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.680
Stop hogging the spotlight.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.770
Let me join.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.350
Penalty for intruding: 2000 points.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.320
Oh no!

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.890
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:55.100
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.140
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.370
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.120
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.790
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.590
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:21.710
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:27.180
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:32.780
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:36.920
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.860
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:43.190
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:50.470
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:53.900
Because I don't want to give up

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:58.910
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:05.980
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:16.490
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.200
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.900
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.690
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.440
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:36.930
Dennis the Magnificent Exchange Student

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:44.000
That's LDS Broadway School's 
exchange student Dennis Mackfield!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.410
He loses 2000 life points 
as a penalty for intruding.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.160
What's going on?

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.950
That didn't happen with Yuzu.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.420
Well...

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.440
I shall explain!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:02.080
In Hiiragi's case, she was 
already dueling Halil.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:10.570
But Dennis wasn't dueling anyone when he 
joined the battle, so he was given a penalty.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:15.110
Ouch...

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:18.480
Aww, did I made a bad first impression?

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.540
I'll regain my composure.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.330
Why did the effect damage disappear?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.720
Oh that.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:33.060
When I joined this duel, I discarded 
Performage Damage Juggler to activate its effect.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:39.060
When a monster deals effect damage, 
it negates that effect permanently.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:45.400
Now Fujin's damage-dealing effect can't 
activate at the end of every turn anymore.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.110
You saved me?

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:51.380
You don't need to thank me.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.610
How dare you interfere!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.550
How rude.  Just when I'm about 
to entertain you even more.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:04.700
Due to Dennis's intrusion, a tag duel 
has started in the Volcano Area!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:10.310
And in the Iceberg Area, 
Olga's turn is starting!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.530
I'll take on both of you.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:24.400
Level 3 Glacial Beast Polar Penguin tunes 
Level 4 Glacial Beast Blizzard Wolf!

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:32.150
Underestimating it will be fatal 
as it stabs with an iceberg horn!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.580
Synchro Summon!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:40.580
Come out, Level 7 Glacial 
Beast Iceberg Narwhal!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.760
Okay, Iceberg Narwhal attacks Yuzu directly!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.430
The Action Spell Blinding Blizzard!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.840
It ends the Battle Phase.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.820
Iceberg Narwhal's effect activates!

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:58.240
When a spell or trap card 
activates during its attack,

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:02.110
the effect is negated, and 
your card is destroyed!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.550
I activate Superheavy 
Samurai Blowtorch's effect!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:14.070
When your monster attacks, I can change 
the attack target to this card!

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:14.930
What?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:24.780
Once per turn, Superheavy Samurai 
Blowtorch can't be destroyed in battle!

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.300
But you can't avoid the damage!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.680
Gongenzaka!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.400
I'm fine!  Don't panic!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.500
Why did you sacrifice yourself for me?

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.680
This is a team battle!  Don't worry about it!

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.770
Gongenzaka...

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:49.590
Gongenzaka's bravery protected Hiiragi!

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.140
You're the man, Gongenzaka!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:54.170
Nice, Gongenzaka!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:59.070
But who's that LDS student who saved Yuya?

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.470
I'll do this magnificently!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.840
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.460
Yuya Sakaki!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.410
Next time, you're finished!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.380
I'll ignore that comment magnificently!

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:12.310
Yuya Sakaki has 200 life points.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.440
One Flame Ball will end it.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:15.860
This is bad!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.330
Oh!  Wonderful!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.510
You're Yuya Sakaki, right?

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:25.420
I'm Dennis Mackfield!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:29.770
I'm an exchange student 
from LDS Broadway School!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.950
Your first round match was wonderful.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.260
It really made me excited!

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:38.300
Umm, we're in the middle of a duel.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.080
Good!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.420
The Action Spell Flame Ball!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.450
You take 200 points of damage!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.400
I found one!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.620
The Action Spell-

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:53.090
Performage Flame Eater!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.020
When there's effect damage,

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.310
that damage is negated, and I 
can Special Summon this card!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:06:59.960
What?

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.120
Okay, it'll work this time!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:08.300
But I didn't really enjoy 
your second round match.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.800
The Action Spell Flame Ball!

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:14.350
You take 200 points of damage!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.130
Action Spe-

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.160
I Special Summon this card again!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.440
Performage Flame Eater!

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:27.550
C'mon!  I'm trying to talk to 
Yuya, but you're interfering!

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.930
But what do I have here?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.180
I have two monsters with the same Level.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.470
That means I should do this.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:41.600
With two Level 4 Flame Eaters, 
I build the Overlay Network!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.330
Show must go on!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.580
Sky magician, travel around 
the stage magnificently!

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.320
Xyz Summon!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:59.690
Appear, Rank 4 Performage Trapeze Magician!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:02.980
All right!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:18.710
Okay.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.910
Now watch this!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:34.560
What a gorgeous summoning!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.540
He's as flamboyant as Yusyo Sakaki!

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.130
I like Michy, but he's cute too!

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.010
When Trapeze Magician is on the field,

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:48.170
effect damage that's equal or less 
than its attack points is negated.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:53.550
You can no longer rely on 
the Action Spell Flame Ball.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.980
My role is done.  I end my turn.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.820
What?  Why now?

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:03.720
The finale suits you better.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.910
Dennis...

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:15.120
We're switching over to 
the Ancient Ruins Area.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:18.970
Syun Kurosaki is dueling against 
three Knights of Duels.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:22.600
How will Kurosaki battle them all alone?

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.280
Have you found Serena?

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.540
No, I haven't heard anything.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:32.350
She's definitely watching 
from somewhere in the city.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.090
Let's battle!

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:41.620
Raidraptor - Rise Falcon, slice everything!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.760
Brave Claw Revolution!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.930
They're not worthy of becoming Lancers.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.040
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.140
I summon Superheavy Samurai Gigagloves!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:11.800
I discard a Superheavy Samurai to 
Special Summon Level 2 Tuner Monster

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:15.200
Superheavy Samurai Trumpeter!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:17.880
Here I go!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:23.600
Level 2 Trumpeter tunes Level 1 
Blowtorch and Level 3 Gigagloves!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.570
Roar, god demon!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.960
Arrive at the raging 
battlefield of ice and snow!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.640
Synchro Summon!

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:40.320
Come to the front lines, Level 6 
Superheavy Samurai Ogre Shutendoji!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.470
When Shutendoji is Synchro Summoned

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:48.790
and there aren't any non-monster 
cards in my graveyard...

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:53.150
...all spell and trap cards 
on your fields are destroyed!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.420
Oh no!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.920
Since the Continuous Trap 
Absorbing Lamp is destroyed,

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:05.780
your card that I took using its 
effect returns to your hand.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.870
This is unfortunate.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.540
All right!  I got my Pendulum Card back!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:16.520
Red Fiend's Pendulum effect ends, so Fire 
Jinn's attack points return to normal.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.110
Shutendoji can attack 
while in defense position!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:21.860
Let's battle!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.220
Attack Fire Jinn!

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:32.970
All right!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.440
Impressive, Gongenzaka!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:35.800
You turned the tables!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.620
Are you sure about that?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.640
When Fire Jinn is destroyed,

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:46.040
I can destroy the monster it battled 
by tributing one Lamp monster.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.530
And you take 600 points of damage.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:50.380
What?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:56.000
I tribute Purple Lamp to 
activate Fire Jinn's effect!

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:58.730
This is bad!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:06.620
Gongenzaka!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.590
Gongenzaka!

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:17.150
Iceberg Narwhal's effect activates.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:20.800
Once per turn, when there's effect damage,

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.020
you take damage equal to that amount.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:28.620
Yuzu!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.570
Yuzu...

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:31.590
Gongenzaka!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.480
I passed the baton to you.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.420
A baton known as a Pendulum Card.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.600
I leave the rest to you!

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.600
Gongenzaka...

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:44.270
I understand!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.200
I'm learning a lot from 
your wonderful friendship.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.040
But you only have 200 life points left.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.530
When it's my turn, it's over.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:53.250
Not yet!

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.780
Watch my show!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.450
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:07.040
I set the Pendulum Scale with the 
already-placed White Butterfly and Scale 9 White Flower!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:22.240
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 4 and 8 simultaneously!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.770
Pendulum Summon!  You're up!

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.750
Soprano the Melodious Songstress!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.860
And Mozarta the Melodious Maestra!

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:42.350
With Soprano, I can Fusion Summon 
without using Polymerization!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.870
I fuse Soprano and Mozarta!

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:49.550
The angel's song!  The supreme genius!

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.740
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.470
Fusion Summon!

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.880
Take the stage with the song of victory!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:02.420
Bloom Diva the Melodious Choir!

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:10.420
Let's battle!  Bloom Diva 
attacks Iceberg Narwhal!

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:20.080
Bloom Diva can't be destroyed in battle 
against a Special Summoned monster,

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.570
and the damage I take is negated!

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:28.580
You take the amount of damage that was 
negated, and your monster is destroyed!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.960
But I'll still have life points left!

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:35.920
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Pianissimo!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.220
One monster's attack points become 
100 until the end of the turn!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.320
What?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.020
The stage is set!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.060
Bloom Diva, sing with all your might!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.740
Reflect Shout!

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:59.170
I'm learning a lot from 
your wonderful dueling!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.370
You're next.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.620
But you don't have a monster 
that you can attack with.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.220
You're done.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.310
No, I can still do something.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:13.020
I activate the Quick-Play Spell De-Fusion!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.460
By returning a Fusion 
Monster to the Extra Deck,

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:19.990
I can Special Summon the monsters 
that were used to Fusion Summon it.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.680
I Special Summon Soprano 
the Melodious Songstress

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.240
and Mozarta the Melodious 
Maestra from the graveyard!

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:32.370
Let's battle!  Soprano attacks you directly!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.840
Oh my god!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.380
Then Mozarta attacks you directly!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:44.000
I'm learning a lot!

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:51.940
Yuzu Hiiragi won using beautiful 
entertainment dueling!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:56.900
The Hiiragi-Gongenzaka team get 
the four wagered Pendulum Cards.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.000
They did it!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.100
That fires me up!  My blood is boiling!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.910
It's your turn.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.000
Show me your entertainment dueling.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.450
Dennis...

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:10.780
Okay!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.880
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:21.950
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 
1 Red Fiend and Scale 7 Red Fairy!

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:36.170
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 6 simultaneously!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.140
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:42.110
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.110
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:46.930
Come out, my monsters!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.150
Level 4 Performapal Silver Claw!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.790
Level 4 Performapal Whip Snake!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:04.480
Yuya...

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.100
Don't worry.

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.930
Relax, Yuya.

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.340
Dennis?

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:16.400
You're afraid of acting like 
how you did against Kachidoki.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:17.910
But don't worry.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.480
Trapeze Magician and I are with you.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:27.730
Bring smiles to the world and the future.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.040
Thank you, Dennis.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.060
Oh, you're welcome!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.080
Here I go!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:42.440
With Level 4 Silver Claw and Whip 
Snake, I build the Overlay Network!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.710
From the black darkness,

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:54.400
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.350
Xyz Summon!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:18:02.180
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.440
You finally took a step into darkness!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:15.060
Summoning that dragon from the 
depths of darkness is proof!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.270
You're wrong.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.510
The fun is only getting started!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:22.880
It's showtime!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:24.740
Everybody enjoy!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.950
Let's enjoy this together!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.280
I'll go first!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.800
I activate Trapeze Magician's effect.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:40.970
By using one Overlay Unit, a monster 
can attack twice this turn.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.500
I choose Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.600
Now I'm up!

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:53.020
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:56.650
By using one Overlay Unit, 
until the end of the turn...

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:00.590
...your Level 5-or-above monster's 
attack points are halved,

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:04.480
and this card gains attack 
points equal to that amount!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:06.750
I select Fujin!

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.420
Treason Discharge!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.340
I use the remaining Overlay Unit!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.460
I select Raijin!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.930
Treason Discharge!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.860
Yeah!

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.870
Nicely done, Dennis!

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.240
Let's battle!

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:32.800
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks Fujin!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.960
Again, Dark Rebellion!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.690
Attack Raijin!

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:51.530
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:03.410
Yuya!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.880
Yuya, you were able to do it!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:10.740
Yeah!  I was able to do the 
best entertainment dueling!

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:13.850
Too bad there isn't a crowd here.

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:18.840
Wonderful!  A huge comeback from adversity!

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:21.390
This is what entertainment 
dueling is all about!

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.040
He did it!

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.280
Yuya won!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.900
Yoko, Yuzu and Yuya both won!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.110
Yes.  Thanks to Dennis!

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.410
It'll be awesome if Michy wins too!

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.130
Why is there a card here?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.480
What's going on?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.220
The card moved on its own?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.980
I caught one!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.460
Who are you?

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.800
This is horrible hospitality.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:09.730
Whatever!  It's your fault that I caught you.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.980
Aren't you that famous cooking duelist?

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:17.600
Nice to meet you.  I'm Michio Mokota.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.550
I have something I want to discuss with you.

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:26.000
Gongenzaka.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.600
Here.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.270
Yuzu, you're the one who won.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:33.000
I can't take them.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:35.330
But it was a tag duel.

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:38.840
In that case, I'll take 
the one that I wagered.

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.970
There's still a long road 
ahead.  Let's both do our best.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.440
Yes, let's do our best!

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:47.140
Thank you, Dennis.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:52.120
I always wanted to meet Yusyo Sakaki Jr.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.320
You know my dad?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.790
Of course!  He's the duelist that I admire.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:02.260
When I teamed up with you, I felt 
like I was teaming up with my dad.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:04.960
Same here.  It was fun.

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:07.670
Let's both survive to the end!

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.080
Yeah!  That's a promise!

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:35.730
As long as there's a smile

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:42.510
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:47.810
I always believe

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:51.330
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:56.960
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.600
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:12.470
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:19.140
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:23.210
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:55.210
I meet Kurosaki in the Ancient Ruins Area.

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:58.750
That's when Knight of 
Duels suddenly attack us!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:02.260
There are many things I want to ask Kurosaki!

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:04.350
About Sora and Academia!

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:06.710
Damn!  I don't have time for this!

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:08.960
No way...

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:13.420
He's been missing, but he now shows up?

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:18.260
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Sora Shiunin Attacks!!

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:20.570
The fun is only getting started!
